Subject: perf(d3d12): optional 2x host MSAA for guest 4x surfaces in the native executor

native_executor_max_msaa_samples (default 0 = as the guest) limits the host
samples of guest MSAA surfaces: 1 renders them single-sampled (as
native_executor_single_sample_msaa), 2 stores guest 4x surfaces as host 2x. Host
sample mode 4 maps each guest 4x sample to the nearer of the standard 2x
positions; the layout's host sample mode field grows to bits 27:29.

The change is in the native EDRAM HLSL, which the builder compiles at build
time, and in the runtime-compiled resolve and stencil-reference sources.
